---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Microsoft Warning — TotalRecalls"
  description="Why Microsoft Defender SmartScreen may show a warning when running TotalRecalls, and how to proceed safely."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Microsoft Warning" }]}
>

<div class="mb-6">
  <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary block mb-2">Microsoft Warning · 05</span>
  <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Microsoft Warning</h1>
  <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Microsoft Defender SmartScreen · Newly launched application</p>
</div>

<div class="space-y-5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground border-t border-border/60 pt-8">
  <p>
    When you launch a newly released application or visit a new website, Microsoft Defender SmartScreen may display a warning stating “Windows protected your PC." This is an automated security measure designed to protect you from unfamiliar apps and sites but does not indicate the presence of malware or other threats.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because TotalRecalls is a newly launched app, you might see this warning until our site gains more reputation with Microsoft. You can safely bypass this prompt to continue installing or running the app by following the steps below.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="space-y-4 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground border-t border-border/60 pt-8">
  <p class="font-bold text-foreground">How to proceed safely:</p>
  <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-3 ml-4">
    <li>Click <strong>More info</strong> on the warning dialog to reveal additional options.</li>
    <li>Then click <strong>Run anyway</strong> to launch the application.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Please ensure you are downloading TotalRecalls only from our official website: <a href="https://totalrecalls.app" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">totalrecalls.app</a>. If you have any doubts or concerns, contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">support@totalrecalls.app</a>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-border/60 pt-8">
  <figure>
    <img
      src="/smartscreen/smartscreen-alert-annotated.png"
      alt="Microsoft Defender SmartScreen alert — click More info"
      class="w-full rounded-sm border border-border/60"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <figcaption class="text-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground mt-3">
      Step 1 — Click “More info” to reveal the options
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
  <figure>
    <img
      src="/smartscreen/smartscreen-run-annotated.png"
      alt="Microsoft Defender SmartScreen — click Run anyway"
      class="w-full rounded-sm border border-border/60"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <figcaption class="text-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground mt-3">
      Step 2 — Click “Run anyway” to launch the app
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

</PageLayout>
